# pacgrab tracks ONLY the tool itself.
#
# This directory is the tool's live BASE (~/pacgrab): it holds the scripts
# plus every generated recipe, built package, downloaded source and repo
# database. All of that is state the tool (re)creates, so it is ignored by
# default and only the files explicitly whitelisted below are tracked.
#
# Whitelist approach: ignore everything, then re-include the tool.

# ignore everything at every level
*

# --- tracked tool files ---
!.gitignore
!README.md
!pacgrab
!pacgrab-tui.sh
!install.sh
